+
+
+Show the Configuration
+----------------------
+
+The :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command prints the application's
+configuration as JSON, which is convenient when debugging how the app was
+configured. ::
+
+    $ flask --app hello config
+    {
+      "APPLICATION_ROOT": "/",
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      "TESTING": false
+    }
+
+The value of any key containing ``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``, or ``KEY``
+is masked as ``***``, so the output is safe to share.
